            ]>
          )>
          <Task { id = "T7.2" name = "Record mirror parity gate before removal" status = "DONE" order = 1 priority = "P0" } (
            <Description ?01M05F1PHM61QDS15NY7N6NGPM>
            在等价 harness 的脚本场景上断言"域投影 == 旧镜像内容"逐消息相等（含 tool_calls 与 anthropic content_parts shape 保真）。镜像删除前必须全绿。
