              compress 不读不写消息数组；compaction 行为测试与等价闸门绿。
              </?01M05F1PHM61QDS15NY7N6NGPS>
            ]>
          )>
          <Task { id = "T7.5" name = "Delete mirror writes" status = "DONE" order = 4 priority = "P0" } (
            <Description ?01M05F1PHM61QDS15NY7N6NGPT>
            三个 append helper 删 mirror push；恢复链删 splice 反向投影；种子只走 semantic 注入（createActor 不再以消息数组为种子来源）。每步过 parity 与等价闸门。
