            ]>
          )>
        ]>
      )>
      <TaskGroup #P8 { name = "Single-Writer Pipeline" status = "DONE" order = 7 } (
        <Description ?01M05F1PHM61QDS15NY7N6NGQ0>
        按决策 8（方案 X）收口：vm.eventBus 是 semantic 事件的唯一传输，MessageHistoryGraph 是 vm 上唯一的 commit 入口，inject 旁路与三个 fence 标记全部消失。
        </?01M05F1PHM61QDS15NY7N6NGQ0>
        <SubNodes [
          <Task { id = "T8.1" name = "Complete eventBus emit entries for non-streaming channels" status = "DONE" order = 0 priority = "P0" } (
            <Description ?01M05F1PHM61QDS15NY7N6NGQ1>
            为 childDone / member chat / member coordination / heartbeat / 种子（delegate spawn）/ effect 回放 在 vm.eventBus 上提供合法 semantic 事件 emit 入口；复用既有 emitUserInput / emitToolCallResult 处理用户/工具结果序列，为复合序列（content_start + content_delta + content_end + tool_call_planned + turn_end）提供薄 emit 包装。emit 路径必须发出 inject 现已发出的全部事件类型，序列形状与归约结果不变。
            </?01M05F1PHM61QDS15NY7N6NGQ1>
            <Acceptance [
              <Criterion { id = "AC-T8.1-emit-entries" checked = true } ?01M05F1PHM61QDS15NY7N6NGQ2>
              六个非流式通道在 eventBus 上都有可调的 emit 入口；emit 出去的事件序列与 inject 当前构造的事件序列字段相等。
              </?01M05F1PHM61QDS15NY7N6NGQ2>
            ]>
          )>
          <Task { id = "T8.2" name = "Make MessageHistoryGraph persistently attached" status = "DONE" order = 1 priority = "P0" } (
            <Description ?01M05F1PHM61QDS15NY7N6NGQ3>
            attachMessageHistory 从"isHistoryTrackedActor gate + executor 三处 attach 入口"改为"conversation runtime 初始化时常驻 attach"。graph 内部按 agentKey 分桶不变；persistence 副作用（appendMessage、recordConversationTranscriptEvidence）按 isHistoryTrackedActor gate，保留既有持久化语义。无 eventBus 时显式失败（不允许写域路径在缺失总线时静默走 inject 旁路）。
            </?01M05F1PHM61QDS15NY7N6NGQ3>
            <Acceptance [
              <Criterion { id = "AC-T8.2-resident" checked = true } ?01M05F1PHM61QDS15NY7N6NGQ4>
              graph 在 vm 启动时常驻；attach 不再以 actor 类型作为决策；persistence 副作用 gate 行为不变；缺失 eventBus 抛显式错误。
              </?01M05F1PHM61QDS15NY7N6NGQ4>
            ]>
          )>
